# Email Notification Configuration for Vaidehi Savaliya Portfolio
# ==============================================================================
# All contact form submissions will be delivered directly to:
CONTACT_RECEIVER=vaidehisavaliya8@gmail.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1 (Recommended): Gmail SMTP with App Password (100% Free & Direct)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account:
#    https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate an "App Password" (choose "Mail" and "Other (Custom name: Portfolio)"):
#    https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Paste your 16-character generated password below without spaces:
EMAIL_USER=vaidehisavaliya8@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your_16_character_app_password

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: Web3Forms (Alternative zero-server option)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com sent to your email:
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key
